  "body": "## Where characteristic 2 starts to pay: a T\u00b2 threshold for root-unit decoders (E6 ties, E7 first gain found; no \u03ba claim)\n\nPackage `research/char2-threshold`. Model, cost formula and lemmas are those of the merged #1590 (exact decoders, Lemma B, ERR1) and of #2111 (three-total decoders); this PR adds the explanation of *where* an F2 gain over v first appears.\n\n**The law (argued).** For root units the dense F2 cost of the full orthogonal pattern is about T \u00d7 (block rank), the block rank is about T, so a gain over v needs more than about T\u00b2 lines.\n\n**Table (CHECKED, exact; cost of an admissible pairing for the exact decoder M = Gram):** D4/D5/D6 tie (cost = v = 12/20/30); E6 ties exactly at 36 = 6\u00b2 (stored basis and B; B0 costs 37 in the first-independent basis); A4\u2013A6 above v (B0 upper bounds 16/25/36; annealing found 16/21/34); **E7 is the first gain found (49 < 63, T = 7; also checked in #1590, G3.E7-dyadic)**; E8 (72 < 120) is known (#1590 ERR1). The E6 B0 value 37 is checked in #1590 (G4.E6). F4 ties at 24 (recorded).\n\n**Fano Levi graph (CHECKED, exact):** it realises over Q at T = 4; the exact minimum F2 cost of the stored realisations (rank(PQ\u1d40) = T, all T blocks nonempty) is 9 (T = 4) and 13 (T = 5) against v = 7: no gain at that size.\n\n**Realisability (RECORDED, numerical):** the Sp4 doily (15 points) realises at T = 4 and not at T = 3; the 63-point Sp6 realises at T = 7, and Levenberg\u2013Marquardt found no realisation at T = 6 or 5. No exact rational realisation is shipped, so these are not CHECKED.\n\n**Scope.** The searches (annealing, cliques, lattice pools) are not exhaustive and are recorded, not re-run; the table costs are costs of specific B (upper bounds on the F2 minimum). There is no claim that T \u2264 6 can never beat v; the law is an explanation plus evidence. No \u03ba claim, no window closed. Context: #606, #1698, #1830.\n\n**Verify.** `bash research/char2-threshold/verify.sh /fresh/dir` (Python standard library and `cc`; seconds; step 0 checks `MANIFEST.sha256` and `SOURCES.json` and stops hard on mismatch; 10 PASS lines including step 0).\n\nPrepared by DreamingOfClouds with Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), via Claude Code; Apache-2.0.\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
